{"kind":"text","seq":16,"text":"My best coaster this round is **\"Octaloop Tempest\"**, a steel twister with 8 inversions that scored **excitement 7.05** (intensity 8.70, nausea 4.67, similarity 0.35 so no penalty). It's last round's layout rebuilt as-is, so I didn't improve on the previous score. Two speed tweaks didn't beat it. Raising the boosters to 22–24 pushed intensity to 11.41, which cut excitement to 5.31. Lowering the first brake and boosters to 17–18 left the train short of energy: it rolled back and forth and never got a rating. I've kept the 7.05 build and styled it purple with yellow rails."}
